r, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#1F2937"> <img src="https://getcarelinkai.com/images/email-logo-on-dark.png" width="148" height="35" alt="CareLinkAI" class="clk-logo-dark" style="display:none;border:0;width:148px;height:35px;font-family:Inter, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff"> </a> </td></tr> <tr><td class="clk-card clk-card-pad" style="background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #E9EAED;border-radius:12px;padding:32px;font-family:Inter, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1F2937"> <h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:22px;line-height:30px;font-weight:700">We got your Family Concierge request</h1><p>Thanks for your Family Concierge request. Nothing has been charged.</p><p><strong>What happens next</strong></p><ol><li>We read your request and start the research.</li><li>When your shortlist is ready, we&#39;ll email you a secure payment link for $399.</li><li>As soon as it&#39;s paid, you&#39;ll get the full shortlist.</li><li>If we can&#39;t put together a useful shortlist, you pay nothing.</li></ol><p><strong>The terms</strong></p><p>Personalized shortlist of care options, with availability and pricing labeled as verified or unconfirmed. $399. We do the research first. When your shortlist is ready, we&#39;ll send you a secure payment link, and you&#39;ll get the full shortlist as soon as it&#39;s paid. If we can&#39;t put together a useful shortlist, you pay nothing. You&#39;re paying for the research and shortlist, not a guaranteed opening or placement.</p><p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px">Questions? Call us at (216) 245-9482. Please don’t share patient details on the line — share them securely at getcarelinkai.com/concierge.</p> </td></tr> <tr><td class="clk-footer" style="padding:20px 4px 8px;font-family:Inter, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color: